 አቺን ደርበን፣ “ኤብ ዋቀዮ እስኒፍ ሃተኡ፤","poem":1},{"text":"መቃ ዋቀዮቲን እስን ኤብፍነ” እሳኒን ህንጄዽን።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/129.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/130.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/PSA/128.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}